{"a":[31,31],"h":"<p>31.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"102\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 101.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 23.2 23.2 23.2 30.0 30.0 46.4 53.2 53.2 60.0 66.7 73.4 73.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"46.4 60.0 66.7 85.4\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Allah için hunefa olmak - her dinden çekilib ıhlâs ile tevhıdi hakka sarılmış bir cemâat olmak<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"142\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 142.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 23.3 23.3 39.0 49.4 56.3 56.3 67.4 67.4 75.0 75.0 87.0 87.0 102.7 110.3 110.3 117.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.0 102.7 117.0 126.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ona hiç şirk koşmamak suretiyle <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"148\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 148.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 23.2 23.2 23.2 30.0 37.4 44.2 44.2 60.0 60.0 71.2 71.2 78.7 78.7 90.7 90.7 106.4 106.4 117.0 123.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"117.0 123.7 132.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve her kim Allaha şirk koşarsa <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"193\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 193.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 23.3 30.0 39.0 51.0 58.6 74.3 84.7 84.7 100.6 100.6 129.0 135.7 144.7 144.7 151.6 158.3 170.3\" y=\"25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"30.0 39.0 39.0 74.3 100.6 108.0 108.0 135.7 144.7 151.6 158.3 170.3 177.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> sanki Semadan sükut etmiş <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"131\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 131.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 24.0 24.0 30.7 30.7 41.3 48.7 64.6 64.6 71.3 71.3 78.0 88.6 88.6 101.3 108.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"30.7 78.0 101.3 108.0 114.7\" y=\"21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> de onu kuşlar didikliyor <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"288\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 287.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.0 33.7 33.7 66.7 66.7 77.3 84.0 96.0 111.7 123.0 123.0 138.7 138.7 150.7 157.6 157.6 157.6 165.0 172.6 188.3 188.3 195.0 195.0 210.7 224.3 224.3 232.6 232.6 240.7 256.6 256.6 264.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"46.6 46.6 84.0 96.0 240.7 264.7 271.6\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve yahud ruzgâr onu uzak bir yere sürüklüyor gibidir. - Şirk böyle mühliktir. İnsanın kalbini didik didik didikler, uçurumlara sürükler. </p>"}